<title>USA: Science Dynamics holders clear acquisition.</title>
<headline>Science Dynamics holders clear acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Science Dynamics Corp said stockholders overwhelmingly approved an increase in the authorized common stock to 25 million shares at the Company's annual meeting on November 7.</p>
<p>The company said the approval allows it to begin its acquisition if Inovative Communications Technology Ltd.</p>
<p>Innovative Communications is engaged principally in the business of digital communications, Science Dyamics said. Its products include a frame relay system, a file transfer system, and a celebrity system.</p>
<p>-New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
